// Static game data for Marvel Champions (French): core set, Green Goblin and Wrecking Crew scenario
// packs, Black Widow, Doctor Strange, Captain America, Hulk, Ms. Marvel and Thor hero packs.
// cards.json and precons.json are generated by scripts/build-data.py; the other packs are written
// by hand from the printed cards (ids "<pack>-<card number>").
//
// Card definition: {id, n name, en English name (player cards, for MarvelCDB text decks), t type,
//   f faction, s set, q copies, l landscape, st stage, hp, hs hand size, th threshold,
//   esc acceleration (number or "X"), bth starting threat,
//   bn / bt / bhs / bst back side name, type, hand size, stage, tr / btr traits (front / back, villains
//   and minions of the scenario packs only), toughness (keyword Ténacité: enters play with a Tenace status),
//   pack, dir pack id and image folder under public/cards/}
